//! Differential ratchet for `src/engine/battleScriptSettormentOpcode.ts`.
//! Expected complete narrow projections, controls, source-order errors, and
//! immutable input behavior are generated by executing the canonical
//! TypeScript handler. Regenerate with `node --experimental-strip-types
//! core-rs/tools/gen-battle-script-settorment-vectors.mjs`.

